flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Initialize Scene & Camera]
    B --> C[Allocate image_buffer]
    C --> D["Set Threads: omp_set_num_threads(t)"]
    D --> E["// OPENMP PARALLEL<br/>#pragma omp parallel for schedule(dynamic)<br/>for j = H-1 downto 0"]
    E --> F["Thread-local RNG: seed_random(42+j, omp_get_thread_num())"]
    F --> G["For each pixel i<br/>Sample SPP rays → ray_color() → accumulate"]
    G --> H["image_buffer[(H-1-j)*W + i] = pixel_color"]
    H --> I{More rows?}
    I -->|Yes| E
    I -->|No| J[Write image_buffer → image_t.ppm<br/>Serial I/O]
    J --> K[omp_get_wtime → speedup / efficiency → CSV]
    K --> L([End])

    style E fill:#0b5394,stroke:#073763,color:#fff
    style F fill:#e69138,stroke:#b45f06,color:#fff
